{
  "note": "OBTRAN 001 (The Eagle and the Senses, QNTM CTRL, Oblivious Transfer, 2021): the poster insert's comic, page 1 of comics/obtran001/source/OBTRAN_Poster_Insert_001_AW.pdf. Eight narration captions, beat list agreed by Paul on 25 October 2026. The journey, set pieces and finale are provisional until the storyboard (G2). Beat ids must match the lettering box ids in assets/meta.json and the voice script.",
